  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Gets the <b>line</b> of the notecard <b>name</b> from the region&#39;s notecard cache immediately without raising a dataserver event.</p>
  <p>Returns the string containing the text of the requested line from the notecard.</p>
</p>
